<title>SWEDEN: Swedish GDP rises 0.8 pct in Q3 1996 vs Q3 '95.</title>
<headline>Swedish GDP rises 0.8 pct in Q3 1996 vs Q3 '95.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Gross Domestic Product (GDP) rose 0.8 percent in third quarter 1996 from the same period a year ago, Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>GDP rose 0.7 percent in Q3 from Q2 this year.</p>
<p>A Reuters poll found the market expected GDP to rise 1.5 percent from a year ago and 0.6 percent from the second quarter of 1996.  </p>
<p>SWEDISH GDP</p>
<p>		Q3 1996    Q2 1996   Q1 1996  Q1-Q3 1996   Q3 1995</p>
<p>		  +0.8	  +0.8	+1.4	+1.0	 +5.0</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
